<title>HONG KONG: New World placement at HK$37.10/shr - source.</title>
<headline>New World placement at HK$37.10/shr - source.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>New World Development Co Ltd was placing 75 million shares at HK$37.10 per share, a source close to the placing agents said on Thursday evening.</p>
<p>The shares last traded at HK$38.00, down 90 cents, before being suspended in the afternoon.</p>
<p>The shares being placed were held by major shareholders who had agreed to subscribe the same amount of new shares, the sources said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
